    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L24-ACTIVITY-006",
      "SourceSection": "24.1: Revisiting an Old Theorem",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Follow these instructions to make a few different triangles. Do you think the instructions always produce a right triangle? Be prepared to explain your reasoning.",
