    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U02-L24-ACTIVITY-012",
      "SourceSection": "24.2: Theorems and Identities",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Using \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) for the two integers, write expressions for the three side lengths.",
